  "title": "Seven in 10 Insurers Say They Deliver Personalized Experiences; Fewer Than Half of Consumers Agree",
  "summary": "A new TransUnion (NYSE: TRU) study reveals a significant gap between insurers’ perceptions and consumer experience. While 70% of insurers say they deliver personalized experiences, only 43% of consumers agree. The disconnect is even more pronounced among Gen Z, with just 32% reporting personalized experiences.TransUnion presented the research ...",
